I have been watching the discussion of food and eating, and I have the
following thought.  If you try and eat something on the floor, you have
to pick it up while eating it.  I don't think many adventurers are going
to get down on their hands and knees and eat the food like a dog.  In
any event I believe that if you do an inventory on your character, you
will find the article of food you were eating on your list.  I think you
can just drop it, and start fighting.  That is what I recall having
happen to me several times.  If it doesn't work this way, then in my
opinion it probably should.


